  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-01-24.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 9 songs; 49 min [1]. Said about its sound: Original had cuts, since corrected; mostly between tracks, but a little music was lost in one or two spots, such as track 2 at 3:32, with occasional pops [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- My Morning Jacket were the opening act for The Blue Dogs at this show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-01-24.aud.flac16**: taped by Low Dog; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Lineage is CD-R to EAC to FLAC level 8, from a copy received directly from the taper in March 2002 [1]",
